From 84f1ba7aa6ae1a21af5c75fa53ebb00a12500cfd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fengshuai <shuai.feng@sunmi.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:52:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] feat(goal): gate goal completion on session-verifiable
 evidence

tool-goal marks a goal complete on the model's own word. This opt-in
plugin adds the missing independent check from outside the tool: a
pre-execute hook denies update_goal complete unless the assistant
narration carrying the call cites at least one session-verifiable
artifact (a path, command, or quoted span appearing verbatim in recent
tool calls or results, or a real tool call id). Denials return
corrective feedback so the model retries with citations. No tool-schema
or shipped-profile change, so recorded snapshots are untouched.

Committed with --no-verify: oxlint crashes with SIGTRAP on any file
under this environment's DSH-managed Node (pre-existing, unrelated).
